1
00:05:23,333 --> 00:05:29,333
The truth is out there… and it’s big!

2
00:10:46,666 --> 00:10:52,666
Bigfoot Family is a animation, adventure, family
film directed by Jérémie Degruson.

3
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:16,000
Bigfoot, Adam's father, wants to use his fame for a good cause.

4
00:21:33,333 --> 00:21:39,333
Protecting a large wildlife reserve in Alaska
sounds like the perfect opportunity!

5
00:26:56,666 --> 00:27:02,666
When Bigfoot mysteriously disappears without a trace, Adam and his animal friends
will brave anything to find him again and save the nature reserve.

6
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:26,000
Adam (voice), played by Jules Medcraft.

7
00:37:43,333 --> 00:37:49,333
Arlo (voice), played by David Lodge.

8
00:43:06,666 --> 00:43:12,666
Connor Mandrake (voice), played by Grant George.

9
00:48:30,000 --> 00:48:36,000
Emma (voice), played by Shyloh Oostwald.

10
00:53:53,333 --> 00:53:59,333
Moose (voice) / Principle Jones (voice) / Wolf (voice), played by Joey Camen.

11
00:59:16,666 --> 00:59:22,666
Guard 1 (voice), played by Kyle Hebert.

12
01:04:40,000 --> 01:04:46,000
Bigfoot Family is a 2020 animated fantasy adventure comedy film directed by Ben
Stassen and Jeremy Degruson, and written by Bob Barlen and Cal Brunker.

13
01:10:03,333 --> 01:10:09,333
An English-language Belgian-French co-production, it is the
sequel to the 2017 film The Son of Bigfoot.

14
01:15:26,666 --> 01:15:32,666
In the film, Bigfoot has become famous after returning home
and uses his fame to fight an oil company.

15
01:20:50,000 --> 01:20:56,000
When he disappears without a trace, it is up to Adam, his
mother, and their animal friends to rescue him.

16
01:26:13,333 --> 01:26:19,333
It premiered at the 2020 Annecy International Animation Film Festival,
before releasing in France and Belgium on 5 August 2020.

17
01:31:36,666 --> 01:31:42,666
The film explores themes of bigfoot, family, candid, adoring, amused.
